<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 22.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 22.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Thursday, May 22:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,582.50 (1,575.60)	CHF  1,125.70 (1,120.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    937.89 (928.91)	  GBP  2,612.70 (2,588.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    133.25 (132.00)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Wednesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $14.86 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$ 9.57 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $24.43 million ($41.11 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
